,{"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":682,"_80":81,"_82":83,"_84":85},"Agent Sprite Forge · 0x0funky",[684],{"_76":87,"_48":685},"https://github.com/0x0funky/agent-sprite-forge",[687],{"_76":93,"_48":688},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0x0funky/agent-sprite-forge/HEAD/src/video2dsprite-ryo/intro.mp4","/GameMap/media/demos/recording-sprite-forge.webp","Sprite Forge 早期介绍短片中的真实画面：生成的 Ryo 角色位于用于抠色的洋红背景上",[692],{"_76":693,"_48":694},"Agent Sprite Forge","/zh/resources/agent-sprite-forge/","这段短片介绍早期 0.3 的 Ryo 工作流程，并非当前 0.4 流程或可玩游戏。生成、抠色和打包仍需对应模型渠道、工具与人工审核。","开发流程","workflow","agent-sprite-forge","demo:recording-autoue-workflow","recording-autoue-workflow","AutoUE · Unreal Engine 自动生成流程","官方演示记录了 Unreal Engine 编辑器中的自动生成工作流程。","/zh/showcase/recording-autoue-workflow/",{"_44":701,"_46":702,"_115":131,"_128":697,"_125":734,"_108":729,"_81":720,"_253":735,"_42":700,"_111":171,"_105":726,"_101":727,"_90":723,"_103":728,"_133":700,"_119":736,"_95":726},[707,708,709,710,711,712,713,714,715,716,717,718,719],"AutoUE · Unreal Engine generation workflow",{"_74":44,"_78":701,"_80":44,"_82":-7,"_84":58},{"_74":129,"_78":702,"_80":46,"_82":-7,"_84":58},{"_74":75,"_76":126,"_78":696,"_80":128,"_82":83,"_84":58},{"_74":75,"_76":251,"_78":735,"_80":253,"_82":83,"_84":85},{"_74":75,"_76":123,"_78":734,"_80":125,"_82":83,"_84":58},{"_74":86,"_76":117,"_88":730,"_80":119,"_82":-7},{"_74":75,"_76":113,"_78":114,"_80":115,"_82":116,"_84":85},{"_74":75,"_76":109,"_78":164,"_80":111,"_82":112,"_84":58},{"_74":75,"_76":106,"_78":729,"_80":108,"_82":83,"_84":58},{"_74":98,"_76":706,"_99":726,"_101":727,"_103":728,"_104":-7,"_80":105,"_82":-7},{"_74":86,"_76":93,"_88":724,"_80":95,"_82":-7},{"_74":86,"_76":87,"_88":721,"_80":90,"_82":-7},{"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":720,"_80":81,"_82":83,"_84":85},"AutoUE · Pluto156 / AutoUE authors",[722],{"_76":87,"_48":723},"https://github.com/Pluto156/AutoUE",[725],{"_76":93,"_48":726},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Pluto156/AutoUE/main/assets/show.mp4","/GameMap/media/demos/recording-autoue-workflow.webp",1.6777777777777778,"AutoUE 官方视频中的 Unreal Engine 编辑器，完整展示关卡视口、场景对象、对象列表与输出日志面板",[731],{"_76":732,"_48":733},"AutoUE","/zh/resources/autoue/","这是作者发布的开发流程录屏，并非可直接在浏览器试玩的构建。复现生成需要 Unreal Engine 集成、素材和外部大模型服务；本次仅验证了视频播放，未运行生成器或逐一测试生成的游戏。","Unreal Engine","autoue","demo:recording-diamond-csgo","recording-diamond-csgo","DIAMOND · CS:GO 的扩散世界模型","作者使用键盘和鼠标操作扩散世界模型的录片；模型以 CS:GO 画面训练。","/zh/showcase/recording-diamond-csgo/",{"_44":739,"_46":740,"_115":301,"_128":302,"_125":771,"_108":766,"_81":757,"_42":738,"_111":171,"_105":763,"_101":764,"_90":760,"_103":765,"_133":738,"_119":772,"_95":763},[745,746,747,748,749,750,751,752,753,754,755,756],"DIAMOND · A diffusion model of CS:GO",{"_74":44,"_78":739,"_80":44,"_82":-7,"_84":58},{"_74":129,"_78":740,"_80":46,"_82":-7,"_84":58},{"_74":75,"_76":126,"_78":295,"_80":128,"_82":83,"_84":58},{"_74":75,"_76":123,"_78":771,"_80":125,"_82":83,"_84":58},{"_74":86,"_76":117,"_88":767,"_80":119,"_82":-7},{"_74":75,"_76":113,"_78":295,"_80":115,"_82":116,"_84":58},{"_74":75,"_76":109,"_78":164,"_80":111,"_82":112,"_84":58},{"_74":75,"_76":106,"_78":766,"_80":108,"_82":83,"_84":58},{"_74":98,"_76":744,"_99":763,"_101":764,"_103":765,"_104":-7,"_80":105,"_82":-7},{"_74":86,"_76":93,"_88":761,"_80":95,"_82":-7},{"_74":86,"_76":87,"_88":758,"_80":90,"_82":-7},{"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":757,"_80":81,"_82":83,"_84":85},"DIAMOND · Eloi Alonso and collaborators",[759],{"_76":87,"_48":760},"https://diamond-wm.github.io/",[762],{"_76":93,"_48":763},"https://diamond-wm.github.io/static/videos/8.mp4","/GameMap/media/demos/recording-diamond-csgo.webp",1.8666666666666667,"低分辨率的 DIAMOND 官方 CS:GO 世界模型录片，展示第一人称武器与石质庭院。",[768],{"_76":769,"_48":770},"DIAMOND — Diffusion for World Modeling","/zh/resources/diamond/","这是对游戏画面的神经预测，并非 CS:GO 引擎或完整游戏源码。原始录片仅 280×150 像素，画面清晰度有限。在本地交互运行世界模型需要公开代码、模型权重与合适硬件。","diamond","demo:recording-genie3-jetski","recording-genie3-jetski","Genie 3 · 灯节水上摩托","Google DeepMind 录制了夜间可控的水上摩托世界，生成的水面与灯